{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30020","headline":"题吴先生山居 · 刘得仁","name":"题吴先生山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生此幽隐，便可谢人羣。\n潭底见秋石，树间飞霁云。\n山居心已惯，俗事耳憎闻。\n念我要多疾，开炉药许分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}